  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Fast Stashing almost full inventory</Major>
    <Description>This macro automatically deposits nearly your entire inventory into your stash with minimal user input. Optimized for 2560×1440 (1440p) resolution and intended for use with the default inventory/stash layout. Other resolutions are not supported.</Description>
